guide forever/horde/40-50/06-azshara
title Azshara, Feralas & Stranglethorn Vale
faction Horde
levels 49-51
zone Azshara
next forever/horde/50-60/01-un-goro-crater
# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 54-64) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Revantusk Village -> fly to the Undercity (Oran Snakewrithe) ->
# zeppelin to Orgrimmar -> fly to Splintertree Post -> ride into Azshara:
# Shadowsong Shrine -> Valormok (flight path) -> Kim'jael and the Thalassian
# Base Camp -> Ruins of Eldarath -> Kim'jael -> Valormok and Archmage Xylem ->
# fly to Orgrimmar -> zeppelin to Grom'gol -> Ironjaw basilisks -> Booty Bay ->
# fly to Grom'gol -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (turn-ins, training) -> Thunder
# Bluff (Druid and Paladin training) -> Camp Mojache (bind) -> the Muisek
# chain and Zorbin's coast -> hearth to Camp Mojache -> fly to Gadgetzan
# (bind) -> Broken Pillar, at the road
# into Un'Goro Crater, where the next guide starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Azshara is one loop (Shadowsong Shrine, Valormok, Kim'jael, the ruins,
#   Kim'jael, Valormok) instead of the export's back-and-forth between
#   Loh'atu and Sanath Lim-yo.
# - The two Stranglethorn stops (visits 55 and 57) are one: Grom'gol, the
#   basilisks and Booty Bay, then a flight back to Grom'gol for the zeppelin.
#   Its hearth and binds (Grom'gol, Booty Bay) are not needed.
# - The two Undercity stops (56, 61): Oran's turn-ins are done when you pass
#   the city at the start; Andron Gant (3542/3564), A Call to Arms (5094) and
#   Seeping Corruption (3568) move to the next guide's Undercity stop, which
#   the route passes on the way to the Plaguelands.
# - The Bulwark stop (60: 5096, 5405, 5407, 5408, 5901) moves to the next
#   guide, which rides past the Bulwark anyway; it saves an Undercity round trip.
# - Orgrimmar (59) is done when the zeppelin from Grom'gol brings you back,
#   before Feralas, and Thunder Bluff (62) on the flight to Camp Mojache, so no
#   city is visited twice.
# - Feralas: the Muisek chain first, then one trip to the north-west coast for
#   the giants and Zorbin (the export goes there twice).
# - Dropped: the Swamp of Sorrows stop (63: Return to Fel'Zerul 1444 and the
#   Fallen Hero chain 2784, 2621, 2622: two flights and a zeppelin for about
#   6,600 XP); Continued Threat (1428) was already turned in earlier.
# - Dropped: Message in a Bottle (594: a beach search and a swim to Jaguero
#   Isle for 2,900 XP), Slake That Thirst (379: needs Into the Field, which
#   the route no longer takes), Yuka Screwspigot (4324: a detour to
#   Steamwheedle Port), Deadmire (1205) and Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog (580:
#   never picked up earlier), A Sample of Slime... (4293: the slime comes from
#   Felwood, after which the route never returns to the Undercity),
#   Samophlange Manual (3924: its pages drop in the Barrens), The Spirits of
#   Stonetalon (1061: never turned in) and Vivian Lagrave (4133: needs level
#   50, and the only Undercity stop before Kargath comes at 49.5).
# - Thunder Bluff's and Grom'gol's binds are dropped (replaced unused); the
#   Camp Mojache and Gadgetzan binds are kept for their hearths.
# - Gadgetzan by air: Tran'rek beside the wind rider master, Pestlezugg and
#   Sprinkle first, then the inn and Marin on the south side, on the way out.
#
# Optional: Rescue OOX-22/FE! (2767), Rescue OOX-09/HL! (836) and Rescue
# OOX-17/TN! (648) if you
# escorted those robots, and An OOX of Your Own (3721), which needs all three
# robots home. A Meeting with the Master (3381) gives no experience, only a
# teleport to Azshara Tower.
#
# Left open for later guides: Jes'rimon's Payment to Jediga (3563),
# Magatha's Payment to Jediga (3562), Betrayed (3504), Bone-Bladed Weapons
# (4300), The Strength of Corruption (4120), Un'Goro Soil (3761), Super
# Sticky (4504), Bungle in the Jungle (4496), The Stone Circle (3444) and
# Delivery to Andron Gant (3542, the next guide's Undercity stop).
#
# Class quests: none here. The level-52 Hunter chain to Ogtinc in Azshara
# (The Hunter's Charm, 8151-8232) is a Class guide
# (forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm): its last part needs Morphaz in
# the Sunken Temple, and Forever took The Green Drake's (8232) reward
# choices away, so it pays experience only.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undercity

step Fly to the Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip From Revantusk Village's flight master, fly to the Undercity.
  fly "Undercity"

step Oran Snakewrithe
  tip Oran stands in the Magic Quarter.
  turnin 2782
  turnin 2995
  accept 8273
  turnin 8273

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Azshara

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar from the tower outside the Undercity, then fly to Splintertree Post.
  fly "Splintertree Post"

step Ride into Azshara
  zone Azshara
  tip Ride east along the road out of Splintertree. Loh'atu waits at the Shadowsong Shrine just off the road, a few steps west of the Alliance's Talrendis Point: come in from the west and keep clear of the Azshara Sentinels and Jarrodenus (elite).
  accept 5535                         -- Loh'atu
  accept 5536

step Highborne and Haldarr satyrs
  tip The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins just north of the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs camp a little further north.
  kill 6116 quest 5535.1
  kill 6117 quest 5535.2
  kill 6125 quest 5536.1
  kill 6126 quest 5536.2
  kill 6127 quest 5536.3

step Loh'atu
  tip Back to Loh'atu at the shrine; stay west of the Talrendis Point guards.
  turnin 5535
  turnin 5536

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Valormok

step Valormok
  tip Follow the road north to Valormok, the Horde camp.
  getfp "Valormok"
  accept 3517                         -- Jediga
  accept 3381 optional                -- Sanath Lim-yo, at the east edge of the camp: no experience, only a teleport to Azshara Tower

step Undamaged Hippogryph Feathers
  tip The Thunderhead Hippogryphs fly over the hills just south of Valormok.
  collect 10450 quest 3381 optional

step Sanath Lim-yo
  turnin 3381 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kim'jael

step Kim'jael
  tip Ride north-east to the goblin's camp on the cliffs above the Bay of Storms.
  accept 3601

step Thalassian Base Camp
  tip The blood elves' camp lies just south of Kim'jael. His four pieces of equipment lie in the crates around the camp.
  collect 10717 quest 3601
  collect 10715 quest 3601
  collect 10718 quest 3601
  collect 10722 quest 3601

step Kim'jael
  turnin 3601
  accept 5534

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ruins of Eldarath

step Ruins of Eldarath
  tip Ride south-west to the ruins. The four tablets lie among the ruins, guarded by Spitelash naga; any Siren or Myrmidon can carry Kim'jael's rune.
  collect 10538 quest 3517
  collect 10539 quest 3517
  collect 10540 quest 3517
  collect 10541 quest 3517
  collect 13815 quest 5534

step Kim'jael
  tip Back north-east to Kim'jael.
  turnin 5534

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Valormok and Xylem

step Jediga
  tip Ride west back to Valormok.
  turnin 3517
  accept 3518
  accept 3541
  accept 3542
  accept 3561
  note Keep the deliveries for Magatha, Jes'rimon and Andron Gant: you pass Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar and the Undercity later.

step Archmage Xylem
  tip Xylem's tower stands on the cliff just north of Valormok; the path winds up its north side.
  turnin 3561
  accept 3565

step Jediga
  turnin 3565

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stranglethorn Vale

step To Grom'gol
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Fly from Valormok to Orgrimmar, walk out of the main gate to the zeppelin towers and take the zeppelin to Grom'gol.
  goto 32.2,27.7 "Grom'gol Base Camp"

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  turnin 2932                         -- Nimboya
  accept 588                          -- The Bubbling Cauldron beside Kin'weelay
  turnin 588
  accept 589

step Ironjaw Basilisks
  tip Follow the road south; the basilisks bask on the rocks east of it in the middle of the jungle. Their shards drop often.
  collect 3911 quest 589

step Booty Bay
  tip Continue south to Booty Bay. Oglethorpe Obnoticus has his workshop on the upper ring of the bay.
  turnin 2767 optional                -- Oglethorpe Obnoticus
  turnin 836 optional
  turnin 648 optional
  accept 3721 optional                -- Only once all three robots are home
  turnin 3721 optional
  turnin 2874                         -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley

step Back to Grom'gol
  fly "Grom'gol"
  turnin 589                          -- Kin'weelay

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Take the zeppelin back to Orgrimmar.
  turnin 81                           -- Dran Droffers, the Drag
  turnin 32                           -- Zilzibin Drumlore, Valley of Spirits
  turnin 7732
  accept 4494
  turnin 3541                         -- Jes'rimon, the Cleft of Shadow
  accept 3563
  accept 4300
  accept 3504                         -- Belgrom Rockmaul, Valley of Honor
  turnin 3923                         -- Rilli Greasygob, Valley of Honor
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  note Keep Jes'rimon's payment and Ag'tor's Betrayed: they go back to Valormok on a later visit.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Bluff

step Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly to Thunder Bluff; it is on the way to Camp Mojache. No flight path there yet? Fly to Camp Taurajo and ride west through Mulgore. Hamuul and Magatha are on the Elder Rise; Druids and Paladins train here (Turak Runetotem, Alodan the Hopeful).
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  getfp "Thunder Bluff" npc 2995      -- Tal
  turnin 3784                         -- Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem
  accept 3761
  turnin 3518                         -- Magatha Grimtotem
  accept 3562
  train class only Druid,Paladin
  note Un'Goro Soil is gathered in the next guide; Magatha's payment goes back to Jediga later.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Camp Mojache

step Camp Mojache
  zone Feralas
  fly "Camp Mojache"
  sethome "Camp Mojache"
  turnin 3123                         -- Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  accept 3124
  accept 3380
  accept 4120                         -- Talo Thornhoof: the bears are in Felwood
  note Keep Sunken Temple for Marvon in Tanaris.

step Frayfeather Hippogryphs
  tip The hippogryphs nest on the hills south-west of the camp. Kill one, then use the Muisek Vessel on its body.
  collect 9595 quest 3124

step Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  turnin 3124
  accept 3125

step Sprite Darters
  tip The faerie dragons flit around the woods just west of the camp. Use the vessel on each one you kill.
  collect 9596 quest 3125

step Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  turnin 3125
  accept 3126

step Wandering Forest Walkers
  tip The treants wander the forest roads between the camp and the middle of Feralas; there are only a few, so look along the paths.
  collect 9593 quest 3126

step Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  turnin 3126
  accept 3127

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Forgotten Coast

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  tip Ride north-west to the Forgotten Coast; Zorbin waits on the dock.
  accept 7725
  accept 7726

step Zapped giants
  tip The Land Walkers and Cliff Giants roam the hills north of the dock. Zap each one with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first: shrunken, they are no longer elite. Every zapped giant drops residue; use the Muisek Vessel on its body too.
  collect 18956 quest 7725
  collect 9597 quest 3127

step Sea elementals
  tip The Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays wash along the shore around the dock.
  collect 18958 quest 7726

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  turnin 7725
  turnin 7726

step Back to Camp Mojache
  hearth "Camp Mojache"
  turnin 3127                         -- Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  accept 3129
  turnin 3129

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  accept 4504                         -- Tran'rek, beside the wind rider master
  turnin 4494                         -- Alchemist Pestlezugg
  accept 4496
  turnin 2641                         -- Sprinkle
  accept 2661
  sethome "Gadgetzan"
  turnin 2661                         -- Marin Noggenfogger
  accept 2662
  turnin 2662
  note Tran'rek's tar and Pestlezugg's samples come from Un'Goro Crater.

step Broken Pillar
  tip Ride south along the road to the Broken Pillar; Marvon Rivetseeker camps beside it. From here the road west leads down into Un'Goro Crater, where the next guide starts.
  turnin 3380                         -- Marvon Rivetseeker
  accept 3444
  note Keep The Stone Circle: Marvon's chest is opened on a later visit.
